The `AssociationConfig` table has a one-to-many relationship with `RequestBodyAssociatedResourceTypeConfig`. This allows for configuring size inspection limits for different associated resource types. The possible resource types include CloudFront, Application Load Balancer, API Gateway, AppSync, and Cognito User Pool. The size inspection limits can have values KB\_8, KB\_16, KB\_32, or KB\_64.

